## CODING_PRACTICES

### GITHUB

- Conventional Commits (`feat:`, `fix:`, `docs:`, `chore:`, `test:`).
- PR descriptions from `.cursor/examples/pr-description-example.md`.
- Protect `main`: tests / build before merge when CI exists.
- Do not commit `.vsix` binaries unless a release asset is explicitly requested.
- Never commit tokens, `state.vscdb` copies, or `.env`.
